params.notes:
* '''Yuumi''' becomes {{tip|ghosted}} for the channel and, if not presently attached with {{ai|You and Me!|Yuumi}}, will remain ghosted until she attaches and detaches again.{{bug}}
* While {{ai|You and Me!|Yuumi|attached}}, {{bi|Cloud Dragon Soul}} will not activate until '''Yuumi''' detaches.
* {{tip|Spell shield}} will only block a single instance of damage.
* '''Yuumi's''' facing direction during the channel is considered to be in ''Final Chapter's'' target direction.
** Using {{si|Hexflash}} during the channel will always cause '''Yuumi''' to {{tip|blink}} in the target direction of ''Final Chapter''.{{bug}}
* {{ai|Feline Friendship|Yuumi}} will not be triggered if '''Yuumi''' and her anchor aren't missing health '''after''' the wave hit.
* The VFX will follow '''Yuumi's''' location, but the actual hitbox of each wave won't.
